<body>
    <div class="page">
        <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">OMB No. 1545-1878</div>
        <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">DIAGNOSTIC REPORT</h1>
        <h2 style="text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0;">Employee Contribution VEBA Trust St. Olaf</h2>

        <div class="header-section">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">
                <div>
                    TRUST NAME: <span data-field="trust_name">{{ trust_name }}</span><br>
                    FEDERAL EIN: <span data-field="federal_ein">{{ federal_ein }}</span><br>
                    TRUST NUMBER: <span data-field="trust_number">{{ trust_number }}</span>
                </div>
                <div>
                    For calendar year <span data-field="tax_year">{{ tax_year }}</span>, or fiscal year beginning <span data-field="start_date">{{ start_date }}</span>, and ending <span data-field="end_date">{{ end_date }}</span>.
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <p style="font-weight: bold;">** No Severe Diagnostics Detected **</p>
            <p>Informational Diagnostics: Total <span data-field="informational_diagnostics_total">{{ informational_diagnostics_total }}</span></p>
            <p>Federal (<span data-field="federal_count">{{ federal_count }}</span>)</p>
            <p>1. Part I, Line 22 (Prior Year) plus Line 19, (Current Year) does not equal Line 22 (Current Year)</p>
            <p style="font-weight: bold;">** No Electronic Filing Alerts Detected **</p>
            <p style="font-weight: bold;">** No Electronic Filing Rejects Detected **</p>
            <p style="font-weight: bold;">** No Electronic Filing XML Validation Errors Detected **</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="text-align: center; font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Form 8879-EO</div>
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div>
                <p>Department of the Treasury</p>
                <p>Internal Revenue Service</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <p>Employer Identification Number</p>
                <p><span data-field="ein_number">{{ ein_number }}</span></p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="full-width">
                <p>Name of exempt organization: <span data-field="organization_name">{{ organization_name }}</span></p>
                <p>Address: <span data-field="organization_address">{{ organization_address }}</span></p>
                <p>City, State, Zip Code: <span data-field="organization_city_state_zip">{{ organization_city_state_zip }}</span></p>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align: right;">
                <p>Tax Year: <span data-field="tax_year_form">{{ tax_year_form }}</span></p>
                <p>Form No. <span data-field="form_number">{{ form_number }}</span></p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-title">Part I Declaration and Signature Authorization of Officer</div>

        <p>Under penalties of perjury, I declare that I am an officer of the above organization and that I have examined a copy of the <span data-field="form_name">{{ form_name }}</span> and I certify that the information contained in this form is correct and complete. I further declare that the amount that the organization is claiming is correct and complete. I consent to any interstate service provider, transmitter, or electronic return originator (ERO) to send to the organization's return to the IRS and to receive from the IRS (as an acknowledgement of receipt or reason for rejection of the return) any information related to this return. I authorize the use of my signature on this form for the purpose of authorizing the use of my signature on the organization's return to the IRS. I designate and authorize the use of my signature on this form to authorize the use of my signature on the organization's return to the IRS. I authorize the use of my signature on this form to authorize the use of my signature on the organization's return to the IRS.</p>

        <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <p>Officer's PIN: check one only</p>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">
                <input type="radio" name="pin_option" value="yes">
                <label>I authorize TIAA Board of Overseer to enter my PIN</label>
                <div style="margin-left: auto;">
                    <label>Enter five numbers, but do not enter all zeros</label>
                    <input type="text" style="width: 50px;">
                    <label>as my signature</label>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p>EO Firm name: <span data-field="eo_firm_name">{{ eo_firm_name }}</span></p>
        </div>

        <p>On the organization's tax year <span data-field="tax_year_pin_ref">{{ tax_year_pin_ref }}</span> electronically filed return, if I have indicated within this return that a copy of the return is being filed with a state agency(ies) regulating charities as part of the IRS Fed/State program, I also authorize the aforementioned ERO to enter my PIN on the return's disclosure consent screen.</p>

        <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <p>As an officer of the organization, I will enter my PIN as my signature on the organization's tax year <span data-field="tax_year_pin_ref">{{ tax_year_pin_ref }}</span> electronically filed return.</p>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 20px;">
                <div style="width: 45%;">
                    <p>Officer's signature</p>
                    <div class="signature-box"></div>
                </div>
                <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
                    <p>Date</p>
                    <div class="signature-box"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="text-align: center; font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Part II Certification and Authorization</div>

        <p>ERO's PIN/EIN. Enter your six-digit electronic filing identification number (EIN) followed by your five-digit self-selected PIN.</p>

        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div>
                <p>EIN:</p>
                <input type="text" style="width: 100px;">
            </div>
            <div>
                <p>PIN:</p>
                <input type="text" style="width: 100px;">
            </div>
        </div>

        <p>I certify that the above numeric entry is my PIN, which is my signature on the <span data-field="form_name">{{ form_name }}</span> electronically filed return for the organization indicated above. I confirm that I am submitting this return in accordance with the requirements of Pub. 4163, Modernized e-File (MeF) Information for Authorized IRS e-File Providers for Business Returns.</p>

        <div class="signature-line">
            <div>
                <p>ERO's signature</p>
                <div class="signature-box"></div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <p>Date</p>
                <div class="signature-box"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-title">Part III Checklist of Required Schedules</div>

        <p>Check if Schedule O contains a response or note to any line in this Part III.</p>

        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 5%;">#</th>
                    <th style="width: 70%;">Description</th>
                    <th style="width: 15%; text-align: center;">Yes</th>
                    <th style="width: 15%; text-align: center;">No</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>1</td>
                    <td>Is the organization described in section 501(c)(3) or 4947(a)(1) (other than a private foundation)? If "Yes," complete Schedule A.</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>2</td>
                    <td>Is the organization required to complete Schedule B, Schedule of Contributors (see instructions)?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>3</td>
                    <td>Did the organization engage in direct or indirect political campaign activities on behalf of or in opposition to candidates for public office? If "Yes," complete Schedule C, Part I.</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>4</td>
                    <td>Did the organization engage in lobbying activities? If "Yes," complete Schedule C, Part II.</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>5</td>
                    <td>Did the organization make any significant changes to its governing documents since the prior Form 990 was filed?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>6</td>
                    <td>Did the organization have members, stockholders, or other persons who had the power to elect or appoint members, stockholders, or other persons who governed the organization?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>7a</td>
                    <td>Are any governance decisions of the organization reserved to (or subject to approval by) members, stockholders, or persons other than the governing body?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>7b</td>
                    <td>Did the organization adopt a conflict of interest policy?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>8</td>
                    <td>Did the organization contemporaneously document the meetings held or written actions undertaken during the year by the following:</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>8a</td>
                    <td>Each committee with authority to act on behalf of the governing body?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>8b</td>
                    <td>Each board meeting?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>9</td>
                    <td>Did the organization maintain records of all transactions and activities?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>10a</td>
                    <td>Did the organization have local chapters, branches, or affiliates?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>10b</td>
                    <td>Did the organization have a related organization?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>11a</td>
                    <td>Did the organization have a written conflict of interest policy?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>11b</td>
                    <td>Did the organization have a written whistleblower policy?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>12a</td>
                    <td>Did the organization have a written document retention and destruction policy?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>12b</td>
                    <td>Did the organization have a written policy for determining compensation of the following persons include a review and approval by independent persons: compensatory, data and contemporaneous substantiation of the deliberation and decision?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>13a</td>
                    <td>Are the organization's ERO, Executive Director, or top management official?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>13b</td>
                    <td>Are other officers or key employees of the organization?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>14a</td>
                    <td>Did the organization invest in, contribute assets to, or participate in a joint venture or similar arrangement with a taxable entity during the year?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>14b</td>
                    <td>If "Yes," did the organization follow a written policy or procedure requiring the organization to evaluate its participation in joint venture arrangements under applicable federal tax law, and take steps to safeguard the organization's exempt status with respect to such arrangements?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>15</td>
                    <td>List the states with which this Form 990 is required to be filed.</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>16</td>
                    <td>Did the organization report an amount in Part X, line 21, for escrow or custodial account liability; serve as a custodian for amounts not listed in Part X; or provide crediting counsel, debt management credit, repair or other services?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>17</td>
                    <td>Did the organization engage in any transactions with interested persons?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>18</td>
                    <td>Did the organization engage in any transactions with interested persons?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>19</td>
                    <td>Did the organization report an amount for loans, buildings, and equipment in Part X, line 107 if "Yes," complete Schedule D, Part I.</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>19a</td>
                    <td>Did the organization report an amount for investments-other securities in Part X, line 12 that is 5% or more of its total assets reported in Part X, line 20?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>19b</td>
                    <td>Did the organization report an amount for investments-real estate in Part X, line 13 that is 5% or more of its total assets reported in Part X, line 20?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>11c</td>
                    <td>Did the organization report an amount for other assets in Part X, line 15 that is 5% or more of its total assets reported in Part X, line 20?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>11d</td>
                    <td>Did the organization report an amount for liabilities in Part X, line 25 if "Yes," complete Schedule D, Part X.</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>12a</td>
                    <td>Did the organization separate or consolidated financial statements for the tax year include a footnote that addresses the organization's liability for unrelated business income?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>12b</td>
                    <td>Did the organization have an unrelated business income tax filing?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>12c</td>
                    <td>Did the organization have an unrelated business income tax filing for the tax year?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>13a</td>
                    <td>Is the organization a school described in section 170(b)(1)(A) or 170(b)(1)(B)? If "Yes," complete Schedule L, Part I.</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>13b</td>
                    <td>Did the organization have revenue agreements with a government entity?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>14</td>
                    <td>Did the organization receive more than $15,000 of gross income from gaming activities on Part VIII, line 9a?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>15</td>
                    <td>Did the organization operate one or more hospital facilities? If "Yes," complete Schedule H.</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>20a</td>
                    <td>Did the organization operate one or more hospital facilities? If "Yes," complete Schedule H.</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>20b</td>
                    <td>Did the organization attach a copy of its audited financial statements to this return?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="text-align: center; font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Part V Statements Regarding Other IRS Filings and Tax Compliance</div>

        <p>Check if Schedule O contains a response or note to any line in this Part V.</p>

        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 5%;">#</th>
                    <th style="width: 70%;">Description</th>
                    <th style="width: 15%; text-align: center;">Yes</th>
                    <th style="width: 15%; text-align: center;">No</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>1a</td>
                    <td>Enter the number reported in Box 3 of Form 1096. Enter -0 if not applicable.</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>1b</td>
                    <td>Enter the number of Forms W-2G included in line 1a. Enter -0 if not applicable.</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>1c</td>
                    <td>Did the organization comply with backup withholding rules for reportable payments to vendors and reportable gaming winnings to prize winners?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>2a</td>
                    <td>Enter the number of payees reported on Form W-2G, Transit of Wage and Tax Statements.</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>2b</td>
                    <td>If at least one is reported on line 2a and is greater than 25, you may be required to file an excise tax return?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>3a</td>
                    <td>Did the organization have unrelated business gross income?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>3b</td>
                    <td>Did the organization have unrelated business income tax filings?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>4a</td>
                    <td>At any time during the calendar year, did the organization have an interest in, or a signature or other authority to execute, any of the following:</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>4b</td>
                    <td>... (list of items)</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>5a</td>
                    <td>Was the organization a party to a prohibited tax shelter transaction at any time during the tax year?</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><input type="checkbox"></td>
